{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And he called its name.</b> That of the altar." "<b>YHWH is my banner.</b> The Holy One, blessed be He, performed for us a banner here. Not that the altar is called YHWH, but rather the one who mentions the name of the altar recalls the banner that the Omnipresent performed — 'YHWH is our banner.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:52:52.245619643Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}